// codebox_hold.gen -- f_vf_lbm: the loop break and one-frame delay of the three state planes (the f_vf_fluid /
// f_ks hold idiom). An identity pass over three planes at the solver size.
//
// Inlets (outer order): first = `r draw` bang (hot; unused in the code, it only triggers the render each frame),
// then the three planes from the stream stage (cold). The planes go on to the collide and mrg stages, which are
// triggered by this stage's outputs, so the whole loop advances exactly once per rendered frame and the
// feedback never retriggers itself. Not benched on its own (four inlets, the codebox bench drives three).
out1 = nearest(in2, norm);
out2 = nearest(in3, norm);
out3 = nearest(in4, norm);
